  "title": "Ben’s Diary – I Miss Home",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-12-24",
  "synopsis": "Ben misses his family over Christmas.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/611/68677b0e7b7357ab71729f49228a01b78b3c8524.mp3?1589791085",
  "series": {
