      "english": "Ben’s Diary – I Miss Home"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "圣诞节学校不放假，我不能回国 ，只能在中国过圣诞节。",
      "traditional": "聖誕節學校不放假，我不能回國 ，只能在中國過聖誕節。",
      "pinyin": "shèng dàn jié xué xiào bú fàng jià wǒ bù néng huí guó zhǐ néng zài zhōng guó guò shèng dàn jié",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "丽丽要和她的男朋友一起过圣诞节，露西和麦克要去旅游，",
      "traditional": "麗麗要和她的男朋友一起過聖誕節，露西和麥克要去旅遊，",
      "pinyin": "lì lì yào hé tā de nán péng you yì qǐ guò shèng dàn jié lù xī hé mài kè yào qù lǚ yóu",
      "english": "There’s no school vacation for Christmas and I can’t go home to my country, so I must spend Christmas in China."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "他们都不能和我一起过圣诞节。",
      "traditional": "他們都不能和我一起過聖誕節。",
      "pinyin": "tā men dōu bù néng hé wǒ yì qǐ guò shèng dàn jié",
      "english": "Lili will spend Christmas with her boyfriend, and Lucy and Mike will go travelling."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "以前的圣诞节，都是和爸爸妈妈一起过的，",
      "traditional": "以前的聖誕節，都是和爸爸媽媽一起過的，",
      "pinyin": "yǐ qián de shèng dàn jié dōu shì hé bà ba mā ma yì qǐ guò de",
      "english": "None of them are able to spend Christmas with me."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "今年的圣诞节只能一个人过，我想家了。",
      "traditional": "今年的聖誕節只能一個人過，我想家了。",
      "pinyin": "jīn nián de shèng dàn jié zhǐ néng yí ge rén guò wǒ xiǎng jiā le",
      "english": "So far I’ve always spent Christmas with my mom and dad."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This year I have no choice but to spend Christmas alone. I miss home."
    }
  ],
